 &lt;/strong&gt;
 소개 :
 &lt;figure&gt;
  &lt;img alt="검떠" src="https://game.donga.com/media/__sized__/images/2026/11/9/024772e75e2f4ea8-thumbnail-1920x1080-70.jpg"/&gt;
